---
// Creed section ported from discovery/archive/legacy-site/about/index.html. One blocked lineage phrase is dropped from the Excellence paragraph (owner undecided).
---
<section class="section-y border-t border-base-300 bg-base-100" id="creed" aria-labelledby="creed-heading">
  <div class="container-uwc">
    <div class="mx-auto mb-[52px] max-w-[820px] text-center">
      <div class="badge badge-outline mb-5 h-auto px-3 py-1 text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-brand-text">USA Wrestling Regional Training Center #513</div>
      <h2 id="creed-heading" class="mb-[18px] text-balance text-[clamp(2.1rem,5.2vw,4.2rem)] font-black uppercase leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em]">
        <span>Excellence</span>{" "}
        <span class="mx-2 font-normal text-brand-text" aria-hidden="true">/</span>{" "}
        <span>Discipline</span>{" "}
        <span class="mx-2 font-normal text-brand-text" aria-hidden="true">/</span>{" "}
        <span>Champions</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-pretty text-[clamp(1rem,1.8vw,1.15rem)] leading-[1.6] text-base-content/70">The three standards behind every practice at United Wrestling Club in Hayward,&nbsp;California.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-4 min-[900px]:grid-cols-3 min-[900px]:gap-6">
      <article class="card card-border border-base-300 bg-base-200 transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-primary">
        <div class="card-body gap-0 px-[26px] py-8">
          <div class="mb-[18px] flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <span class="font-accent text-[1.8rem] font-black leading-none text-brand-text">01</span>
            <span class="badge badge-ghost h-auto px-2 py-1 text-[0.68rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-base-content/70">The Standard</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="card-title mb-1 text-[1.7rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[-0.01em]">Excellence</h3>
          <h4 class="mb-4 text-[0.85rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-warning">Technical Mastery</h4>
          <p class="mb-[22px] grow text-pretty text-[0.88rem] leading-[1.65] text-base-content/70">Wrestling is physics under pressure. Rooted in Coach Naweed's Kinesiology foundation, we drill 2-on-1 Russian ties, explosive level changes, and hip control.</p>
          <div class="text-[0.82rem] italic leading-[1.55] text-base-content">&ldquo;Technique is the great equalizer on the mat.&rdquo;</div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card card-border border-base-300 bg-base-200 transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-primary">
        <div class="card-body gap-0 px-[26px] py-8">
          <div class="mb-[18px] flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <span class="font-accent text-[1.8rem] font-black leading-none text-brand-text">02</span>
            <span class="badge badge-ghost h-auto px-2 py-1 text-[0.68rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-base-content/70">The Grind</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="card-title mb-1 text-[1.7rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[-0.01em]">Discipline</h3>
          <h4 class="mb-4 text-[0.85rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-warning">Relentless Work Ethic</h4>
          <p class="mb-[22px] grow text-pretty text-[0.88rem] leading-[1.65] text-base-content/70">No shortcuts. No excuses. Discipline means showing up when you're tired, holding stance when your legs burn, and staying accountable to your training partner.</p>
          <div class="text-[0.82rem] italic leading-[1.55] text-base-content">&ldquo;How you do anything is how you do everything.&rdquo;</div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card card-border border-base-300 bg-base-200 transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-primary">
        <div class="card-body gap-0 px-[26px] py-8">
          <div class="mb-[18px] flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <span class="font-accent text-[1.8rem] font-black leading-none text-brand-text">03</span>
            <span class="badge badge-ghost h-auto px-2 py-1 text-[0.68rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-base-content/70">The Outcome</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="card-title mb-1 text-[1.7rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[-0.01em]">Champions</h3>
          <h4 class="mb-4 text-[0.85rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-warning">Character in the Circle</h4>
          <p class="mb-[22px] grow text-pretty text-[0.88rem] leading-[1.65] text-base-content/70">A champion is defined before the whistle and long after the hand is raised. We build humble winners and respectful leaders who carry the mat's quiet confidence into the classroom.</p>
          <div class="text-[0.82rem] italic leading-[1.55] text-base-content">&ldquo;Once you've wrestled, everything else in life is easy.&rdquo;</div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
